          <h2 class="archive-article__title">Community Advisory Committee Application Now Open</h2>
        </a>
        <p class="archive-article__date">09.15.25</p>
      </div><!-- end archive-article__header -->
      <div class="archive-article__content">
        <p>Austin City Council (City Council), Austin Transit Partnership (ATP), and CapMetro are seeking applicants for the Project Connect Community Advisory Committee (CAC).</p>
        <a href="https://www.atptx.org/community-advisory-committee-application-now-open/" class="archive-article__button button">View More</a>
      </div><!-- end archive-article__content -->
    
  </div><!-- end archive-article__grid -->
